  "description": "<p>Hangover Helper is a wellness-focused brand that combines the power of coffee with specially selected recovery ingredients to help users bounce back after a night of overindulgence. We&rsquo;re committed to providing high-quality products that energize, hydrate, and aid in the recovery process, all while keeping things fun and relatable.</p>\r\n<h3>&bull; Product Description:</h3>\r\n<p>Hangover Helper Relief is a unique coffee blend made with premium Single Origin Sulawesi coffee, combined with turmeric, cinnamon, ginger, and black pepper. It&rsquo;s specially formulated to support faster recovery from hangovers, providing both energizing caffeine and natural ingredients that aid in the body&rsquo;s healing process.</p>\r\n<h3>&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point):</h3>\r\n<p>Unlike traditional coffee or over-the-counter remedies, Hangover Helper combines the invigorating power of coffee with the health benefits of turmeric, cinnamon, ginger, and black pepper&mdash;creating a holistic recovery solution in a single cup. It's the perfect balance of flavor, wellness, and energy.</p>\r\n<h3>&bull; Payment Terms:</h3>\r\n<p>We offer 3% of commissions for affiliates, paid on a monthly basis via&nbsp; bank transfer, with a minimum payout threshold of $50. Payments will be processed at the end of each month after confirming sales and performance.</p>\r\n<h3>&bull; Other Information:</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>We provide affiliates with all the necessary marketing materials, including banners, images, referral links and terms of use.</li>\r\n<li>Affiliates will also have access to exclusive promotions, product updates, and early access to new launches.</li>\r\n</ul>",
